node_modules/
# All generated from ../art and src/ by the tools in this folder. Regenerating
# is one command and costs a second; keeping a 1.4MB binary in history that
# churns on every art change is not worth the saved step.
# The icons are generated too, but by arithmetic rather than from ../art, and
# they are 150kB that changes only when the mark does. Kept, so a deploy from
# a fresh clone does not need a build step nobody remembers.
public/atlas.png
public/atlas.json
public/manifest.json
public/bundle.js
public/bundle.js.map
# the smoke test's screenshot: paths in here are relative to this folder,
